---
import HeadlineBlock from '@/partials/headline/headline-block';
---

<section id="about" data-slot="about-section" class="w-full bg-black mask-y-from-95% p-4 pt-0">
  <div
    data-slot="container"
    class="align-start flex flex-col justify-center pt-20 text-white md:grid md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr] md:gap-10"
  >
    <section data-slot="about-me" class="flex flex-col">
      <HeadlineBlock
        className="items-start"
        headlineClass=""
        headlineVariant="h2"
        subHeadline="About"
        subHeadlineClass="text-subheadline"
        postHeadline="I am a front-end developer."
        postHeadlineClass="bg-gradient-text pt-2 text-transparent"
      >
        My name is Sasha
      </HeadlineBlock>

      <p class="text-text-gray pt-7 text-base font-light">
        I was born and began my way in Ukraine but was somewhat interrupted in the process.
        Currently I am working on my opportunities in Germany.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-gray pt-5 text-sm font-light">
        I might not have years of experience in development yet, but I am:
      </p>

      <section data-slot="personlichkeiten" class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-4">
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <h5 class="text-headline block h-full text-base font-bold">Resilient</h5>
          <p class="text-text-gray-dim text-sm font-light">
            — adapted to completely new conditions and kept moving forward.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <h5 class="text-headline block h-full text-base font-bold">Adaptive</h5>
          <p class="text-text-gray-dim text-sm font-light">
            — learned a new language in two years.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <h5 class="text-headline block h-full text-base font-bold">Communicative</h5>
          <p class="text-text-gray-dim text-sm font-light">
            — I can explain what I know clearly enough that others actually understand it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <dl class="text-text-gray-dim grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-16">
      <div
        class="align-center flex w-full flex-col-reverse justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-6"
      >
        <dt class="text-center text-base">Tools & Technologies</dt>
        <dd class="bg-gradient-text text-center text-4xl font-extrabold">20+</dd>
      </div>
      <div
        class="align-center flex w-full flex-col-reverse justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-6"
      >
        <dt class="text-center text-base">Languages Spoken</dt>
        <dd class="bg-gradient-text text-center text-4xl font-extrabold">4</dd>
      </div>
      <div
        class="align-center flex w-full flex-col-reverse justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-6"
      >
        <dt class="text-center text-base">Degrees</dt>
        <dd class="bg-gradient-text text-center text-4xl font-extrabold">2(+1)</dd>
      </div>
      <div
        class="align-center flex w-full flex-col-reverse justify-center rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/3 p-6"
      >
        <dt class="text-center text-base">Years training</dt>
        <dd class="bg-gradient-text text-center text-4xl font-extrabold">1+</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
